        {
          "text": " Kwaŋin aponi kitebeai Aburaam emanikor loka Epuron, loajai toma Makupela, loitei Mamure, emanikor ka abua naajai toma, ka ikito kere luajaas toma omanikor, luerimorito eikoruke kere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
